    "detailed_description": "Zen Quest is a relaxing mindfulness game where you design Zen gardens, learn meditation, partake in mindfulness activities, and explore enchanting spirit worlds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/8228f96068f5f5565b799122daf984c6.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/b43a2f66d61575d37075281324335f74.poster.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/b43a2f66d61575d37075281324335f74.webm?t=1736053916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/b43a2f66d61575d37075281324335f74.mp4?t=1736053916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Create Serenity:</strong> Craft unique Zen gardens with traditional elements like stones, water features, and plants.<br></li><li><strong>Express Creativity:</strong> Experiment with layouts to reflect your sense of tranquility and aesthetics.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Watch your gardens change with time, responding to your care and the seasons.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/3a378f94eba9242a5f44f10f7942eced.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/fc47c76ec7725dccbe0e901c33ea073f.poster.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/fc47c76ec7725dccbe0e901c33ea073f.webm?t=1736053916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/fc47c76ec7725dccbe0e901c33ea073f.mp4?t=1736053916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Guided Sessions:</strong> Engage in guided meditation practices to relax and clear your mind.<br></li><li><strong>Mindful Exercises:</strong> Participate in simple, interactive exercises designed to cultivate mindfulness and inner peace.<br></li><li><strong>Wellness Tracking:</strong> Monitor your progress in mindfulness and see its impact on your garden.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/bc6da4c8ad0380efc4b332bc1baabd2e.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/6f3203140ac5ecd1da75514fe635dc95.poster.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/6f3203140ac5ecd1da75514fe635dc95.webm?t=1736053916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/6f3203140ac5ecd1da75514fe635dc95.mp4?t=1736053916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Mystical Explorations:</strong> Embark on journeys to ethereal spirit worlds, each offering unique insights and visual wonders.<br></li><li><strong>Spiritual Encounters:</strong> Meet and interact with mythical creatures and learn ancient wisdom that influences your garden.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Zen Quest is a relaxing mindfulness game where you design Zen gardens, learn meditation, partake in mindfulness activities, and explore enchanting spirit worlds.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/8228f96068f5f5565b799122daf984c6.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/b43a2f66d61575d37075281324335f74.poster.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/b43a2f66d61575d37075281324335f74.webm?t=1736053916\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/b43a2f66d61575d37075281324335f74.mp4?t=1736053916\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Create Serenity:</strong> Craft unique Zen gardens with traditional elements like stones, water features, and plants.<br></li><li><strong>Express Creativity:</strong> Experiment with layouts to reflect your sense of tranquility and aesthetics.<br></li><li><strong>Dynamic Environments:</strong> Watch your gardens change with time, responding to your care and the seasons.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/3a378f94eba9242a5f44f10f7942eced.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=80 /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2660110/extras/fc47c76ec7725dccbe0e901c33ea073f.poster.avif?t=1736053916\" width=614 height=244 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as